    <string name="mobile_settings_support">Support</string>
    <string name="lemuroid_help_content"><![CDATA[
        <b>&#8226;How do I use Lemuroid?</b><br/>
        Copy all your ROMs files into a directory on your device and select it within Lemuroid. This directory is allowed to have subdirectories. After the scan completes you should see your games.<br/><br/>
        <b>&#8226;Why aren\'t my games detected?</b><br/>
        If your games are compressed, try uncompressing them. If this doesn\'t work try putting ROMs into separate directories, one for each system with the following names: $SYSTEMS.
    ]]></string>

    <string name="lemuroid_crash_disclamer">It looks like the Libretro core has experienced an unexpected issue. If it\'s persistent please try the following:\n
        \n\u2022 Disable auto-save and re-run the game
        \n\u2022 Go into Android settings and clear the app cache
        \n\u2022 Go into Lemuroid settings and perform a Factory Reset
        \n\n If none of the above works, it might be possible that this Game/Core is not supported by this device.
    </string>

